Package: oofem
Version: 2.6
Architecture: riscv64
Maintainer: Gurleen Kansray <gurleen72542@gmail.com>
Description: OOFEM finite element solver — riscv64 cross-compiled
 Object Oriented Finite Element Method solver. Cross-compiled for riscv64.
 Validated: NR solver converged to 1.312e-16 under qemu-riscv64-static.
 Part of LFX RISC-V HPC porting effort.
Depends: libc6
